<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-HUVITUSFOND PAYS 2.74 PCT EXTRA INTEREST.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-HUVITUSFOND PAYS 2.74 PCT EXTRA INTEREST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huvitusfond (the Compensation fund) said on Monday that it would pay 2.74 percent of supplementary interest for the first half of the year.</p>
<p>Its total interest together with a guaranteed seven percent is 9.74 percent, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 62092 01, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
